# Secret Manager secrets mounted into both Cloud Run services (neosleep-api-dev/-prod)
# as env vars of the same name. One name per line. Read by .github/workflows/deploy-api.yml.
# Values are copied from Render by sync-secrets-from-render.sh, never committed.
# Non-secret config lives in dev.env.yaml / prod.env.yaml instead.
#
# A listed name without a secret in Secret Manager fails the deploy — create the secret
# first, then add its name here in the same PR.
#
# The first four came from Render (the only secrets it ever had). The rest were added
# 2026-09-25 to switch on features Render never had configured (Google login, Supabase
# Storage, OrthoApnea, Google Calendar, Google Maps geocoding).
# Web push (VAPID_*) is intentionally absent: the PWA has no push-subscription code yet.
DATABASE_URL
SESSION_SECRET
RESEND_API_KEY
INTERNAL_JOB_SECRET
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET
SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY
ORTHOAPNEA_PASSWORD
GOOGLE_CALENDAR_CLIENT_SECRET
GOOGLE_CALENDAR_REFRESH_TOKEN
GOOGLE_MAPS_SERVER_API_KEY
